    reverie-kvm: route timestamp reads through Tool
    
    Trap subscribed CPL3 RDTSC and RDTSCP instructions at the KVM exception boundary and return the existing Tool handler's result. Preserve native execution for unsubscribed guests, propagate interception across fork and thread vCPUs, and restore the architectural instruction state without creating a second clock domain.\n\nCover exact TSC/AUX values, repeated reads, boundary decoding, unrelated exception refusal, unsubscribed execution, and thread/fork/exec lifecycle inheritance.

